== (i) the (3,2) seal: invariant tensors and arithmetic ==
  dim Inv_SU(3)(3 x 3 x 3)   = 1   (epsilon_3: the color contraction of QQQ)
  dim Inv_SU(2)(2^x4)        = 2   (two epsilon_2 pairings of QQQL's four doublets)
  charge arithmetic: 3x Q(1,1) + L(0,-1) = (3,2);  fermion number F = 4 (EVEN)
  the QQQL seal: nonabelian singlet, univalence-even, charge (3,2): PASS
  -> L2 receipted: the ledger's own dim-6 row (P25, B-L = 0)
     is a sealed univalence-even singlet generating the
     (3,2) direction.

